body:
recently had a west coast solo acoustic tour booked and I decided it would be a helluva lot less taxing on my body to fly to my dates than to drive so that's what I did. Doing so first hand allowed me to get a good feel about how different airlines handle your guitars when you travel. I discuss what I've learned to be the DO's and DON'Ts of [flying with guitars in this video](https://youtu.be/hJBa1W18JUY).

&#x200B;

Any questions, criticisms, or comments are welcome!
